[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7442.229, "timestamp": "02:04:02", "text": "同じ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7443.83, "timestamp": "02:04:03", "text": "私は思う。ええ、相変わらずですね。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7446.229, "timestamp": "02:04:06", "text": "なぜ改善されていないのか理解できない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7452.109, "timestamp": "02:04:12", "text": "私が考えるように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7458.189, "timestamp": "02:04:18", "text": "2015年か2017年に叔父は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7463.669, "timestamp": "02:04:23", "text": "えっと、アテルだと思う。アテルは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7466.31, "timestamp": "02:04:26", "text": "計画はここで、叔父が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7468.87, "timestamp": "02:04:28", "text": "多くの企業とビジネスをしています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7470.709, "timestamp": "02:04:30", "text": "通信会社やモバイルなど"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7474.629, "timestamp": "02:04:34", "text": "企業に所属していたため、彼は早期アクセス権を得ることができた。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7476.91, "timestamp": "02:04:36", "text": "おお、いいね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7480.07, "timestamp": "02:04:40", "text": "うん。だから私は良いインターネットを持っていた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7481.149, "timestamp": "02:04:41", "text": "のように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7484.47, "timestamp": "02:04:44", "text": "それは私の成長には何の役にも立たなかった子供だった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7491.669, "timestamp": "02:04:51", "text": "人。子供の頃は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7493.35, "timestamp": "02:04:53", "text": "他の子供たちと同じように交流し、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7494.629, "timestamp": "02:04:54", "text": "どういう意味ですか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7495.87, "timestamp": "02:04:55", "text": "みんな"}]